        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You know where to go, who to talk to, and how to make new connections, fast. Upon entering a new settlement, spending 1 day of downtime allows you to build enough connections to make use of the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Leverage Connections]{Connections} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Criminal Connections] feats. If you're legendary in Society, you can form the required connections within 1 hour of entering a new settlement.</p>"
